    {
      "source": "Recursively unwraps well known wrapper types from the given <a href=\"../TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>.",
      "translation": "递归地解包给定的<a href=\"../TypeInformation.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.core 中的接口\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>中已知的包装类型。",
      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a non-projecting variant of a mapped type.",
      "translation": "创建一个非投影的映射类型变体。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a projecting variant of a mapped type.",
      "translation": "创建一个映射类型的投影变体。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Transparently returns the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> value type if the type is a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>, returns the\ncomponent type if the type <a href=\"../TypeInformation.html#isCollectionLike()\"><code>TypeInformation.isCollectionLike()</code></a> or the simple type if none of this applies.",
      "translation": "如果类型为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>，则透明地返回其值类型；如果该类型满足<a href=\"../TypeInformation.html#isCollectionLike()\"><code>TypeInformation.isCollectionLike()</code></a>条件，则返回其组件类型；否则返回其简单类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"../../mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> for the given <a href=\"../TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>.",
