      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a> from the given source if it is a more concrete type than the given default one.",
      "translation": "如果给定源的类型比给定的默认类型更具体，则从该源返回 <a href=\"../TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the alias to be used for the given <a href=\"../TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回用于给定<a href=\"../TypeInformation.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.core 中的接口\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>的别名。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a> for the given raw super type.",
      "translation": "返回给定原始超类型的<a href=\"../TypeInformation.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.core 中的接口\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Specializes the given (raw) <a href=\"../TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a> using the context of the current potentially parameterized\ntype, basically turning the given raw type into a parameterized one.",
      "translation": "使用当前可能带有参数的类型的上下文来特化给定的（原始）<a href=\"../TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>，基本上是将给定的原始类型转换为参数化类型。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Recursively unwraps well known wrapper types from the given <a href=\"../TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a> but aborts at the given\nreference type.",
      "translation": "递归地解包给定的<a href=\"../TypeInformation.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.core 中的接口\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>中已知的包装类型，但在到达指定的引用类型时中止。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the type information for the property at this segment.",
      "translation": "返回此段中属性的类型信息。",
      "count": 2
    },
