    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a>s for all <a href=\"../../mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>s in the <a href=\"../../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>.",
