    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a href=\"../TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a> to represent the <a href=\"../TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a> of the raw type of the current instance.",
